#show: template

#taxon[Definition]
#title[cartesian decomposition]

A cartesian decomposition of a finite set $Omega$ is a collection $Ee$ of partitians $Gamma_1, ..., Gamma_l$ of $Omega$ such that
$
 |gamma_1 nn ... nn gamma_l| = 1 " for all " gamma_1 in Gamma_1, ..., gamma_l in Gamma_l.
 $
